FILE: vUX-domDrawer.js
FEATURE: component-teardown
DATE: 2026-09-17
PRIOR STATE: as left by feature 'resizer-docs'

REASON
The two delegated listeners ('mousedown' on the drawing surface class, 'mousemove' on
that class plus 'dItem') discarded their return values and the document 'mouseup'
listener was never removed, so a drawer outlived its surface. destroy() detaches all
three, removes the generated 'v<className>' sheet, and clears the shapes drawn so far.
Shapes are matched on '.dItem.v<className>' rather than '.dItem' so that a page running
two drawers only loses the shapes belonging to the instance being destroyed.

